# Prompt stepper + file pages

Saved paste: `.cursor/saved/prompt-stepper/`. Live port: `PromptInstructionStepper.jsx` on prompt-file page 1.

## Title

- File instance = `prompt.name` (default from the uploaded file name).
- Card / float title = `step.title`, seeded from that instance, **editable**.
- Do not bind the visible prompt title to `prompt.name` again. One PDF can hold prompts with different roles.

## Pages

- **Page 1** = instructions. Render the saved vertical stepper; each instruction section is Step 1, 2, 3…
- **Pages 2+** = pure prompts (no instruction/prompt face mix on those pages).

## Port rules (when the user asks to place it)

- JSX + CSS in the prompt desk. No `lucide-react`, `cn`, or `@/` aliases.
- Surface = `var(--surface-base)`.
- Do not confuse with document `StepSequenceBlockView`.
- Page 1 of a prompt file mounts this stepper. Do not reuse document `StepSequenceBlockView`.
